	"data": "Task System & Gamified Productivity\n\nWhat It Is\nA recurring design thread: making task management feel like a game. Distinct from skill trees (which are about learning) — this is about the daily execution layer. Tasks from CalDAV/Nextcloud, broken down by AI, scheduled into time blocks, with streaks and points for completion.\n\nThe Dec 2023 Design Session\nA hand-drawn note photographed and fed to ChatGPT — the clearest early artifact:\n\nTask System components:\nPull existing tasks from…",
